Optional repository builds
--------------------------

The native Rust long-term feature and optional reader-enabled WebAssembly
artifact compile sofars 0.6.1 (MIT, with retained SOFA terms). These artifacts
are separate from the pure-Python wheel and dependency-free JavaScript loader.
The complete upstream notice is retained at
rust/ephemeris-core/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and must accompany redistribution
of those builds. Neither those builds nor this package are endorsed by the
IAU SOFA Board.

Ephemeris kernels and embedded Chebyshev tables
-----------------------------------------------

This package bundles compressed Chebyshev polynomial derivative tables
(src/ephemeris_oss/data/*.zlib, covering 1550 CE through 2306 CE) fitted by
The Million Dollar AI Studio Ltd. from NASA Jet Propulsion Laboratory
Development Ephemeris DE440 (Park et al. 2021, AJ 161:105). Full raw NASA NAIF
SPK planetary ephemeris files (de440.bsp, de441.bsp) are not redistributed in
the wheel and may be downloaded on demand from NASA NAIF at run time. Their use
does not imply endorsement of this package by NASA, JPL, Caltech or NAIF.

US Naval Observatory data used only in the separate accuracy study are public-domain government data; the study and bulk kernels are not bundled in the wheel.
